<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Fashion Style — Boutique</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@500;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{--bg:#0E0E0E;--gold:#C9A45C;--cream:#F5F1E8;--muted:#9A9A9A;}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--cream);}
.wrap{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:0 22px;}
header{padding:24px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;letter-spacing:.05em;}
.brand{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-weight:700;font-size:22px;}
nav a{color:var(--muted);margin-left:20px;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;}
.hero{padding:60px 0 50px;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,164,92,.2);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(201,164,92,.2);}
.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;}
h1{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,54px);font-weight:700;line-height:1.05;}
.hero p{color:var(--muted);margin-top:16px;font-size:14.5px;max-width:340px;}
.btn{display:inline-block;margin-top:24px;border:1px solid var(--gold);color:var(--gold);padding:12px 24px;font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;text-decoration:none;}
.swatch{aspect-ratio:3/4;background:linear-gradient(160deg,#2b2b2b,#151515);border:1px solid rgba(201,164,92,.3);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;color:var(--gold);font-size:15px;}
.collection{padding:50px 0;}
.collection h2{font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;font-size:24px;margin-bottom:24px;text-align:center;letter-spacing:.03em;}
.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px;}
.item{aspect-ratio:3/4;background:#191919;border:1px solid rgba(201,164,92,.15);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;}
footer{text-align:center;padding:36px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;border-top:1px solid rgba(201,164,92,.2);}
@media(max-width:640px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.grid3{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="wrap" style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;width:100%;"><div class="brand">FASHION STYLE</div><nav><a href="#">Collection</a><a href="#">Contact</a></nav></div></header>
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid">
<div><h1>L'élégance,<br>sans effort.</h1><p>Pièces sélectionnées pour un style affirmé, du quotidien aux grandes occasions.</p><a class="btn" href="#">Voir la collection</a></div>
